  "notes": "Release date from the changelog and the docs page (open weights, 2026-04-28); an Internet Archive capture of the Hugging Face repository on 2026-04-29 is consistent with that (lead only). The blog post of 2026-05-22 launched it in public preview as the default model in Le Chat and Mistral Vibe; that launch is recorded as a milestone, not as the release date. Mistral calls it its first flagship merged model, combining instruction following, reasoning and coding in one set of weights; prominence is standard because it is a point version in the Medium 3 generation. The model card and blog also say it replaces Devstral 2 in the Vibe coding agent; no relation to Devstral or Magistral is recorded. The docs page lists the API names mistral-medium-3-5, mistral-medium-3 and mistral-medium-latest; mistral-medium-3 and mistral-medium-latest are not recorded as aliases because they also fit or move between other records."
